Added the conversion of a Confluence XML space export into the `plone.exportimport` format for `kitconcept.intranet`: spaces become Workspaces, pages become Wiki Pages with their content converted to Plate, attachments become Files and Images, and comments become Plone comments and Wiki Page discussions. The `analyze` command reports what an export holds and which macros it uses, and the `convert` command writes the result with reports of every item, issue, and skipped object. @ericof
